                    drafting information is given.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d17-f2" n="1" xml:id="d17-f2-content">
                <p>Rolando Masferrer, a former pro-Batista Cuban senator.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d17-f3" n="2" xml:id="d17-f3-content">
